      187.68
     ],
     "text": "Comparative growing trial"
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Comparative growing trial",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    43.2,
    192.72,
    255.36,
    289.92
   ],
   "id": "e6",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.44,
      192.72,
      254.88,
      201.36
     ],
     "text": "All characteristics described are from a comparative"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.44,
      203.52,
      255.36,
      212.4
     ],
     "text": "growing trial conducted at Cressy Research Station, near"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      214.56,
      255.12,
      223.44
     ],
     "text": "Launceston, Tasmania, in 1990 and 1991. 100 spaced"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.44,
      225.6,
      254.64,
      234.24
     ],
     "text": "plants of each variety were planted in a randomised com-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      236.64,
      254.88,
      245.52
     ],
     "text": "plete block design with 10 blocks. Each plot contained"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      44.64,
      247.68,
      254.88,
      256.56
     ],
     "text": "10 plants (2 rows x 5 plants) of a particular variety with"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      258.96,
      254.88,
      267.6
     ],
     "text": "a between plant spacing of 60cm. A similar trial was also"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      270.24,
      254.64,
      278.88
     ],
     "text": "planted in 1990 at Cressy Research Station which"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.44,
      281.28,
      236.16,
      289.92
     ],
     "text": "included only the varieties \u2018Jackaroo\u2019 and \u2018Roper\u2019."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "All characteristics described are from a comparative\ngrowing trial conducted at Cressy Research Station, near\nLaunceston, Tasmania, in 1990 and 1991. 100 spaced\nplants of each variety were planted in a randomised com-\nplete block design with 10 blocks. Each plot contained\n10 plants (2 rows x 5 plants) of a particular variety with\na between plant spacing of 60cm. A similar trial was also\nplanted in 1990 at Cressy Research Station which\nincluded only the varieties \u2018Jackaroo\u2019 and \u2018Roper\u2019.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    42.72,
    294.96,
    255.36,
    424.08
   ],
   "id": "e7",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.44,
      294.96,
      254.64,
      303.84
     ],
     "text": "In addition to evidence of distinctness and stability, the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      305.76,
      254.4,
      314.4
     ],
     "text": "applicant has submitted photographic prints of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      316.56,
      255.36,
      325.2
     ],
     "text": "results of SDS-polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      327.36,
      254.64,
      336.0
     ],
     "text": "extracted seed protcins. These demonstrate a difference"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      43.2,
      338.4,
      254.64,
      347.04
     ],
     "text": "in banding pattern between the varieties analysed and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      349.2,
      254.4,
      357.84
     ],
     "text": "consistency between the two samples of \u2018Jackaroo\u2019. The"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      360.24,
      254.4,
      368.88
     ],
     "text": "analytical method used is essentially as described in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      371.04,
      254.4,
      378.96
     ],
     "text": "Gardiner, SE and Forde MB (1987), Seed Science and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      382.08,
      254.4,
      390.96
     ],
     "text": "Technology /5, 663-674, modified by the use of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      393.36,
      254.4,
      402.0
     ],
     "text": "extraction medium described by Smith, DB and Payne,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.96,
      404.4,
      254.4,
      413.04
     ],
     "text": "PI (1984), J. natn. Inst. agric. Bot. /6,487-498. The"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      42.72,
      415.44,
      254.4,
      424.08
     ],
     "text": "method is fully described in \u2018Identification of cultivars"
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "In addition to evidence of distinctness and stability, the\napplicant has submitted photographic prints of the\nresults of SDS-polyacrylamide gel electrophoresis of\nextracted seed protcins. These demonstrate a difference\nin banding pattern between the varieties analysed and\nconsistency between the two samples of \u2018Jackaroo\u2019. The\nanalytical method used is essentially as described in\nGardiner, SE and Forde MB (1987), Seed Science and\nTechnology /5, 663-674, modified by the use of the\nextraction medium described by Smith, DB and Payne,\nPI (1984), J. natn. Inst. agric. Bot. /6,487-498. The\nmethod is fully described in \u2018Identification of cultivars",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
